WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
ano toki umareta no

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
あのとき生まれたの

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
I'll softly give you my thoughts

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
watashi no omoi sotto ageru

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
私の想いそっとあげる

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
That were born at that moment

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
shinjite ite

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
信じていて

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
Please believe in them

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
deatta hi kara

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
出逢った日から

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
Since the day when we met

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
hajimete no kimochi megutteru

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
初めての気持ち巡ってる

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
For the first time, I have these feelings, and they go around

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
honto no egao hoshii nante

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
ホントの笑顔ほしいなんて

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
I want your true smile

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
anata ga oshiete kureta sorao

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
あなたが教えてくれた空を

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
I embrace the sky

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
dakishimete yume o miru

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
抱きしめて夢をみる

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
That you told me about and dream

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
tooi keredo・・・

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
遠いけれど・・・

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
It's faraway, but...

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
atatakai hikari no kakera

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
あたたかい光のかけら

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
The fragments of warm light

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
kizutsuita hane ni inochi o kureta no

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
傷ついた羽根に命をくれたの

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
Gave life to my wounded wings

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
fureta toki umareta

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
触れたとき生まれた

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
Born at the moment when we touched

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
tsuyoi watashi no soba ni

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
強い私のそばに

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
Next to me, who is strong

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
mamoraretai watashi ga nemutte ita no

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
守られたいわたしが眠っていたの

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
The me who wants to be protected was asleep

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
sou unmei kaerareru ne

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
そう運命変えられるね

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
That's right, destiny can be changed

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
futari no koi mezamesasete・・・

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
ふたりの恋目覚めさせて・・・

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
Let our love awaken...

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:29.940
{last frame of OP}

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:42.120
You don't mind hot places, right?

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:44.240
For someone who has the nerve to stalk,

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:46.460
I've got the perfect country to send you off to.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.370
I won't give up to someone like-

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:53.460
I'm a dispute mediator who carries out his jobs without fail.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.460
The next time you run off,

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:55.920
You'll be exiled to a deserted island in some distant sea!

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.420
So, just give up.

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:07.850
What the heck was that?

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.190
Don't move!

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:16.490
No...

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:18.990
I don't need this now...

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.370
Damn it...

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:36.260
First Episode 「Climactic Night」

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.840
It tastes bad.

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.420
Is that so?

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.340
Yeah, it tastes like salt water.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.680
I've had enough.

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:42.970
Benika-sama.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:46.140
Yayoi, she says it tastes like salt water.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:08.370
It's hard to envision this landscape as the center of worldly affairs.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:12.250
Could the person residing there be a god?

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.760
The path to the interior house is in the back of the main wing, right?

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.880
There was someone who saw her from a window inside the maid quarters.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.510
And was it Benika?

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.430
We don't know that much yet.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.390
You don't know?

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.310
Yes.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.470
Was there anyone named Benika or not?!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.640
We haven't seen her.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:32.230
What a disgrace.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:35.020
Bring me the one who saw her!

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:41.400
We cannot step foot beyond this point.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.660
It seems Murasaki has been taken away.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:56.040
The young lady has been in the Inner Sanctuary ever since she was five.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:04:00.300
She had a rough upbringing as you may have known, Renjou-sama.

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.220
She's been doing everything she has been-

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.010
You don't need to tell me that now!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:06.470
The young lady wished to go outside, so...

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:08.810
Women of the Inner Sanctuary are no exception!

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.640
You should know that she has never gone outside before.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:17.310
But, compared to your unexpected incident some time ago,

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.400
this is rather cute.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.820
Are you in any position to talk about my appearances?

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.490
Souju-sama has given up.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.530
However!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.700
It was the young lady's wish-

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.870
Damn woman!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.250
Were you manipulated by Benika?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.290
That's not it. Souju-sama just cannot grant the young lady's...

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.460
Silence!

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.710
Just what the hell do you think the Kuhouin's personal affairs are?

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:49.140
You women are vile creatures who do things based on foolish ideals.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.100
Renjou...

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:55.440
Your love for Souju has led to a great decay in our family,

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.610
and this disgrace will eventually lead to the seeds of rebellion.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:03.110
In order to see to it that this outcome never arises,
you must abandon your current home.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:08.910
If you dive into this with nothing but emotions,
you will betray the expectations of our predecessor.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:09.910
Understood.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:14.660
There are no exceptions even if Souju is to give birth to a girl.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.790
Yes.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:22.050
I, Renjou... have never questioned the Inner Sanctuary.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:26.340
Forget Souju and move on with Kazuko.

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:29.260
Renjou-sama, they say it's a girl.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:35.270
Kazuko, the violets look beautiful today, don't they?

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:41.110
Even the silently blooming violets, which seem to draw attention to you, can see your beauty.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.610
Those wild flowers?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.650
Sometimes I don't notice and step on them.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:47.780
I thought so...

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.070
Is there something wrong?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:53.450
I have chosen to name my daughter Murasaki.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.700
Souju!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:55.830
Mother!

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.040
How many times must I say it until you understand?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:57.830
Please forgive me.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.290
I was running and that's why my obi-

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.000
This woman hasn't even learned 
how to tie an obi properly!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.670
Mother! Mother!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.170
If this had happened when we went to my grandfather's, just who do you think would be ashamed?!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.170
Mother!

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.720
I will tie it once more.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.010
You don't need to do anything anymore!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:11.090
Mother! It was because I ran!

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.470
Be quiet!

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:17.980
That's a rather strange arrangement, but it does reveal your personality.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.270
I learned it from my mother.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.770
Then it's no wonder that it includes two of Kazuko-sama's favorite flowers.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.030
No, not Kazuko-sama's.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.360
Kazuko-sama? If you don't call her mother...

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:32.870
No, Kazuko-sama is not my mother.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:34.660
You should know that.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.120
I wonder if she feels sorrow for losing Souju...

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.290
People around her age...

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:47.050
It would have been nice if she could go to the countryside and simply play to recover.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.090
You led Benika here, didn't you?

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.810
We were only thinking of the young lady.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.890
Damn women.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.440
Remember the view of this garden well.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:08.400
Because from here on out, you will be in a social class which will make any chance of return uncertain.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.200
I can't go back to this house?

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:15.830
If your wish can be granted, then it may happen.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.960
I know her. That girl from the commercial, right?

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:22.580
Ensaio?

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:23.880
That's right, Ensaio.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.880
You like that? I don't.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.090
No, the sword she uses sometimes is nice.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:30.420
Then Gotou would be better.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.630
The one on TV yesterday?

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.340
That's it. Did you see it, Shinkurou?

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:34.850
Yesterday I was...

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.640
Gotou is real nice!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.640
She's got it all!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.310
And that something-dachi guy.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.850
Yeah, yeah, it was awesome!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.980
Gotou-chan?

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.860
If you want that information, then I'll make it cheap.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.940
Why are you charging me money?

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.450
This is for your job too, right?

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.240
But it's something you'd know if you watched TV.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.870
You don't have a TV though.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.240
I just bought one.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.080
I'm surprised you had enough money.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.620
Did you get a good job or something?

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:03.960
Well yeah. My client, this lady, said it was a thank you gift,

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.830
and gave it to me separate from my pay.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:08.170
I hope Juusawa Benika doesn't find out then.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.250
Shinkurou-san.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.800
Is it time already, Yuuno-san?

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.260
In about ten minutes.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:15.510
You're right.

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:18.930
Well, if you need anything, e-mail me.

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:19.430
Sure.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:22.980
Oh, Murakami-san, is it all right with you?

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:23.810
Is what?

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.100
Didn't you have some business with Shinkurou-san?

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:29.150
We've already finished and it wasn't anything important anyway.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.780
You don't need to say it like that.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:31.860
Good bye.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.910
I don't get along with her.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:39.200
She sometimes gives me a scary look.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.580
She wasn't always like that.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.460
Back when she was young, she was much kinder.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.870
Really?

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:45.580
Yeah.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.630
You two are together a lot during school.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:49.750
Really?

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:50.250
Yes.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.460
You think so?

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.510
Maybe it's true...

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.260
Let go, you punk!

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.680
Be quiet and give up already!

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.890
I said later!

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:04.480
Damn it!

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.650
It's always like this... damn it!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.280
Is school really that fun?

00:09:14.690 --> 00:09:16.280
You're talking about that again?

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.490
That's right.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.620
What about jobs?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.080
You're short on money already?

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.490
Very...

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:25.040
What about the pay from the other day- A thank you gift, was it?

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:28.210
It's all right, it was only meant as thanks.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.290
So, did you buy something?

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:29.880
A television.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.130
Yayoi-san!

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.210
A 15 inch LCD television.

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.300
That's tiny.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.930
That aside, I'd like to get in on a big job.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.550
Today's job just involved a vandal.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:42.970
It's not like I have any you would want though.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:44.350
I just want you to recognize me.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.350
I wonder if you're strong enough for that.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.730
I won't know unless I try, but...

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:51.020
I've been able to do all my jobs so far, right?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.070
I'm getting stronger and training, too...

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:56.570
Do you mean that convenient body you obtained?

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.490
This is a fine power too...

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.700
It's a terrible body.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.700
But that's why I can fight, right?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.660
You won't fight against yourself though?

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.290
Why are you teasing me?

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.830
Didn't you know?

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:13.250
If you can't fight against yourself, then you can't fight against anyone else.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:15.630
You also know that nothing can be gained from destruction, right?

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:19.630
I want to become stronger and have you recognize me.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:25.520
It's impossible for him if you think about this job's scale.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:30.350
I make important decisions based on my own intuition, not logic.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:32.940
I've always done it this way.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.650
But...

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:44.990
Are you hungry, Davide?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.080
Hey, boy.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:47.910
Yes?

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.670
Don't give him food yourself.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.380
Sorry about that.

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:55.090
Um...

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:56.460
What is it?

00:10:56.460 --> 00:11:00.010
I've been thinking about this for a while now but, is that skull real?

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:01.220
This?

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:01.890
Yes.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.350
This was...

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:07.180
...a part of the man I loved.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:10.060
He was a really sincere man.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:16.020
He became a freelance journalist in order to convey the truths of the world.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.900
He used to tell me many unusual stories, too.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:23.530
But, he met a terrible end.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.700
It happened when he went to a country in turmoil.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.450
He stepped on a land mine it seems.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.790
I suppose it's my way of mourning for him.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.050
I apologize for asking something so strange.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:42.470
That was a pretty good story I just made up, no?

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.600
Would a grown man's skull really be this size?

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.810
No matter how you look at it, it obviously belongs to a monkey or something else.

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.770
Use some more common sense.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.400
Hey, boy.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:02.990
Looks like you'll be having women troubles today.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.490
Women troubles?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.830
That's right, women troubles.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.290
Oh, women troubles?

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.380
It's like a requirement to become a good man.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:18.460
If you're not a good man, women won't approach you.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.920
You won't find a relationship without women troubles.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:21.630
I see...

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:25.260
I wouldn't know whether you're a good man or not unless I tested you but,

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:27.680
you look like you have a plan.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.510
Not at all.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.180
It's all right, there's no need to hide it.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:34.520
I may not look it, but I have a lot of life experience, so come talk to me anytime.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.400
Yes, yes.

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:39.480
You can talk to me about life's troubles, life's troubles, and life's troubles!

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.400
I'm fine.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:44.400
Come straight to me when you need to talk to someone, okay?

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:54.960
Benika-sama.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.880
I wonder how long it's been since I last came here.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.430
In March, during that stalker incident.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:10.050
That's right.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:11.350
Um...

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.100
This girl?

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.520
Who is she?

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.730
Kuhouin.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.440
Kuhou...?

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.520
Kuhouin Murasaki.

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:24.570
I want you to protect her.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.990
Me? Here?

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:27.740
Yes.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.280
Is this a formal job request?

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:30.780
Yes.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.750
How old are you, Murasaki-chan?

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.830
She'll be seven this year.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:41.130
Um, protect her? Is she being targeted by someone?

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:42.000
Yes.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:42.460
By who?

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:43.000
I can't say.

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:44.420
Why me?

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.590
Because I think you're qualified.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.090
In this apartment?

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:50.720
It's because this apartment is rundown that they won't surmise she's here.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.020
Is there a problem?

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:03.570
Of course there is.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.650
Then, you won't accept?

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.570
Abandoning her, huh?

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.040
Sorry for coming.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.580
Um, what are you going to do with her?

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.590
Look for someone else.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:40.730
I'll do it. I'll protect her.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:46.030
Please let me do it.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:53.030
I'm Kurenai Shinkurou.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.330
Nice to meet you.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.330
I am Kuhouin Murasaki, don't touch me!

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:00.920
Shinkurou, was it?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.920
Where is my room? Take me to it.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.710
It's here.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.750
What? Then where's the bedroom?

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:07.510
Here.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.590
The dining room?

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:09.130
Here.

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.220
The living room?

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:10.800
Here.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:11.930
And the bath?

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:12.510
There isn't one.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:17.560
Are you treating me like a fool just because I'm a child?

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.980
You're telling me to do everything here besides bathing?

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.650
That can't be true!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.610
There's no way anyone could live here!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.280
What kind of rich girl are you?

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.610
Hey, answer me!

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:32.320
You do everything here! It's not a lie or anything.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:36.160
I live here everyday.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.080
Don't deny my lifestyle.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:44.080
Well, it's true that my servants' living quarters were rather small...

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:49.130
I see, so you do live here.

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.550
Do you want me to go outside?

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:57.510
Why?

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:58.600
You're changing, right?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:03.060
You're going to take care of my kimono, so you can't go out.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:05.810
I see...

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.870
Did Benika-san buy that for you?

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:19.740
That's a secret.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.960
It looks like Yayoi-san's tastes.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:28.670
Servants do not talk like that.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.880
I'm not a servant though.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.760
I'm the man who's going to protect you.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.470
I see.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.390
Would you like me to turn off the lights?

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:41.180
What are you going to do?

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:42.560
Where's your futon?

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:43.430
Right here.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.440
Can you even sleep in that?

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.650
I've never heard of it before.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.230
I can sleep. I can sleep in any situation.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.150
I see.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.900
So you can do that.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:56.490
Let's go to sleep.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.320
Okay.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:16:59.330
Good night.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.120
Good... night.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.160
Good... night.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.460
You can't sleep?

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.840
You don't need to worry.

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:18.720
Benika-san told you it was safe here, right?

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:21.100
You should sleep.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.470
You should sleep when you can.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.230
Is that so?

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.690
Yeah, that's right.

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.280
Good night, Murasaki.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.780
What? School?

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:41.450
That's right. Didn't you go to one?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:42.660
I didn't.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.870
Kuhouin women don't need to attend school.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.210
Even though it's mandatory?

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.000
What's that?

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.500
Forget it...

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.670
For now, I have to go to school.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.550
Are you just going to leave me?

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.380
I can't take you.

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:00.260
You said you'd protect me.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:03.310
You'll be safe here. Benika-san told you, right?

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.640
Are you really going?

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.100
It can't be helped.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.270
And tomorrow?

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.310
Everyday except weekends and national holidays.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:10.900
That many?

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.770
It'll be all right.

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:16.150
No one comes here and it'll be fine if you don't go outside.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:19.610
I see, that's how it is...

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.320
I'll be home by evening.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.410
So you're really going?

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:24.910
I'm going.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:26.290
Okay.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.840
Kuhouin?

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:38.050
Is that a job from Juusawa Benika?

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.300
I'm amazed that you know.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:42.140
She's not someone you should be taking jobs from.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.810
So, she is rich!

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:47.390
She's really rich. You should turn down the job before it gets problematic.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:52.770
So, what do you want to know about Kuhouin?

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:57.860
Her name is Kuhouin Murasaki, they say she turned seven this year.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.150
Girl?

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:01.110
Yeah, something wrong?

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:04.120
No, I'll look into it.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:05.830
Sure.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:10.920
You're kidding me...

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.490
It's not my fault.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.530
She left on her own.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.580
It couldn't be helped.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:52.790
Hello?

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:55.630
It's me, did you need something?

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:59.590
I was just wondering what she prefers to eat.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.920
She likes fish, I think.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.930
That's perfect then. Pike is cheap right now.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:06.970
Is that all?

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:07.890
Yes.

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:10.270
Sorry for calling you over something like this.

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:11.980
No, thank you.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:12.980
No...

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.150
Then call me if anything happens, bye.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.400
Yes, excuse me.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.740
Damn...

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.160
Murasaki must be crying.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.830
She's crying without anyone to rely on.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:37.170
She's crying just as I once did.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:39.960
Murasaki...

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:44.590
This is Yayoi.

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:46.470
Where is Murasaki?

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.680
She's all right, I have found her.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:52.350
I see, then it's fine.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.350
It really is impossible for him.

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:55.810
Before there are any problems...

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.150
Shinkurou is looking for her now, right?

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.150
He left her alone, you know.

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:03.070
It's because I said Samidare Apartment is safe.

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:04.570
He just went to school, right?

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.410
What the heck am I doing?

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.290
I can't become strong like this...

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:22.000
Murasaki?!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.380
Murasaki...

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.840
Thank god, were you here this whole time?

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.310
I'm sorry, I couldn't find you.

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:34.310
It's not something a servant needs to apologize for.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.850
It's because I went to school...

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.650
You had to go, right?

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.230
I even said I'd protect you.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:40.940
It couldn't be helped, right?

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:43.360
I promised you but, I left you alone.

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:44.400
So what?

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:47.490
I'm sorry. I made you cry.

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:50.780
I'm not crying! There's nothing for me to cry about before you!

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:52.700
I'm not lonely or anything at all!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:58.170
I'm a coward but, I'm not afraid of being by myself or feeling lonely!

00:21:58.620 --> 00:22:00.840
Living and dying are the same!

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:03.340
Just like my poor mother...

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:07.340
I'm the same as my dead mother who couldn't do anything!

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:14.720
I'm sure you'd feel lonely if you were all by yourself.

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:15.930
I'm sorry.

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:19.020
Don't touch me! I'm Kuhouin Murasaki!

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:19.560
I'm sorry.

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:21.860
I'm Kuhouin Murasaki!

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:23.230
I'm...

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:24.280
K-Kuhouin... Murasaki...

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:25.400
K-Kuhouin... Murasaki...

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:29.450
I know. I know you are, Murasaki.

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:35.870
I'm sorry...

